Cell["\<\
Replaces the string heads \"\[Sigma]\" and \"\[Lambda]\" with PauliMatrix and \
GellMannMatrix, and CircleTimes with KroneckerProduct, then applies \
FullSimplify.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->280299973,ExpressionUUID->"7e232c26-c887-7d4f-a086-74ee390c1352"],

Cell["\<\
Use the expression returned by PauliGellMannAbstract, or construct an \
expression with those same string heads. Ordinary symbols named sigma or \
lambda are not replaced.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1228605025,ExpressionUUID->"43245faf-3e49-cb4b-aa56-3cd96ad9a5c7"]
}, Closed]],

